{"deleteScheduledEmailReminder returns early when immediateDelete is true, cancelling the SendGrid scheduled send but not deleting or marking the corresponding workflowReminder DB record, which may leave orphaned reminders that will be picked up again later or clutter the DB": 0.9250248074531555, "The cron cancellation query selects reminders by cancelled: true without scoping to method: EMAIL and without filtering out referenceId = null, which can attempt to cancel non-email reminders via SendGrid or send invalid batch_id values, causing errors and preventing proper cleanup": 0.973445475101471, "The new cancelled field is nullable and has no default, which can introduce tri-state behavior (null vs false) and make future queries/logic inconsistent - should default to false and be non-null, with existing rows backfilled appropriately": 0.6899329423904419}